data: {"id": "7937440848fe497b-thinking-parallel_evidence-978", "run_id": "7937440848fe497b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据采集结论\n\n### 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 当前状态 (Kubernetes + Metrics)**\n   - **状态**: `Pending`，容器 `app` 处于 `Waiting` 状态，原因为 `ImagePullBackOff`（Metrics 中 `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 1，reason 为 \"ImagePullBackOff\"）。\n   - **重启次数**: 0（`kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` 值为 0），说明 Pod 自创建以来从未成功启动过容器。\n\n2. **异常根因证据 (kubectl_describe Events)**\n   - **核心事件**: `Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"`\n   - **错误原文**: `failed to resolve reference \"registry.invalid/aiops/wo", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788766846689, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

