data: {"id": "7937440848fe497b-final", "run_id": "7937440848fe497b", "seq": 983, "ts_ms": 1788766858330, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv` | ImagePullBackOff | 镜像仓库域名 registry.invalid 配置无效导致 DNS 解析失败，使容器运行时无法拉取镜像。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\": ... failed to resolve reference ... dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` | 确认拉取失败的直接原因是 DNS 解析 `registry.invalid` 失败 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Pod Status | `status: Pending` | 确认 Pod 始终处于等待拉取镜像的阻塞状态 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubelet | `BackOff pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"` (发生 155 次，持续 36 分钟) | 证实重试行为持续且失败结果未改变 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (container=app, reason=ImagePullBackOff, value=1) | 从监控指标角度独立确认了镜像拉取阻塞状态 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nKubernetes 事件（#1）明确指出了网络层面的解析失败，配合 `Pending` 状态（#2）和重试事件（#3），形成了从配置错误到容器运行时的完整证据链。Prometheus 指标（#4）从监控维度独立确认了当前容器确实处于 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态，与 K8s 事件描述的故障阶段一致。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n无效镜像仓库域名配置 (registry.invalid) → DNS 解析失败 (no such host) → 容器镜像拉取失败 → Pod 处于 Pending/ImagePullBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 Pod 配置了无效的镜像仓库域名 `registry.invalid`。该域名无法解析导致容器运行时无法获取镜像，直接表现为 Pod 长期停留在 `Pending` 状态且不断重试拉取。此结论得到了 K8s Event 中明确的 DNS 错误原文以及 Prometheus 指标状态的交叉印证。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 52.7s\n├─ 问题定位: 18.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 27.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv: 27.5s (Evidence 22.9s, RCA 4.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 52.671, "metrics": {"run_id": "7937440848fe497b", "mttr": {"value": "52.7s", "seconds": 52.679070472717285, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 52679.070472717285, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 47326.11680030823, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 8, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 12240.581274032593, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4948.390007019043}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18136.110305786133, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 27517.88568496704, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "